{"title":"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a geometric sequence of real numbers, the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/d/7fd34ff50f8bba26a08bc96a69e921daa60f5f12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. The sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> terms is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/0/7d0fca974cabf69c971faf928b8de5dfea34a05a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 28\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 32\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 35\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 49\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 84$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"394\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the first term of the sequence and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> be the common ratio.  Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/6/a76a72baf55d6d1b05b6bb01ea0146ac52489b23.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+ar = a(1+r) = 7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"173\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/1/c41759b284d0f295ed2b23964a8ce09e9b5b65dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+ar+ar^2+ar^3+ar^4+ar^5 = a(1+r)(1+r^2+r^4) = 7(1+r^2+r^4) = 91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"608\" height=\"21\" />.  So <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/9/6/a96b422b1b721e4e891651177b9de90fd8ccdbbb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+r^2+r^4=13$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/1/f41098bbc44cd6a4522bad91ad4062aab19da780.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^4+r^2-12=(r^2-3)(r^2+4)=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"278\" height=\"21\" />.  Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/5/5/b55ca7a0aa88ab7d58f4fc035317fdac39b17861.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> is real, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/f/b7f4b25abe83f767268e2d2ebc094d71250dd190.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$r^2 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"51\" height=\"17\" />, so the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/8/0282bbe901b53731cc2b1e2ca42496a4e2c311db.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+ar+ar^2+ar^3 = a(1+r)(1+r^2) = 7\\cdot 4 = \\boxed{(\\textbf{A})\\ 28}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"441\" height=\"32\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Denote the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> terms as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" />. Since we know that the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/d/7fd34ff50f8bba26a08bc96a69e921daa60f5f12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$91$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/6/0262eb9d1dbd432465a72b53079be591db4e79d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7 \\cdot 13$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"39\" height=\"13\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/7/3f79c3676b62fb47243e0d357c87115b6f3395e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"22\" height=\"13\" /> + <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/1/e81bcdae6b9f3547966bc7bef372197bef6cca8b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$xy^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"26\" height=\"18\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/7/d0754006e8076725203b9480c832d70e7fa8f1f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$13x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"28\" height=\"13\" /> because it is a geometric series. We can quickly see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and therefore, the sum of the first <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> terms is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/2/cd2d0364baffd3b8226cc2a389df1c922d2c10e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4x = 4 \\cdot 7 = \\boxed {(\\textbf{A})\\ 28}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"165\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~Arcticturn\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME\" title=\"1981 AHSME\">1981 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1981 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1981\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1981 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1981_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1981 AH